        <mxCell id="sources" value="Sources of Pending Funds&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sale at a listed price.&lt;br&gt;Acceptance of the highest bid.&lt;br&gt;Your bid is replaced by a higher bid.&lt;br&gt;You withdraw your highest bid.&lt;br&gt;An NFT you bid on is bought via its listing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Withdrawal sends all pending funds to the caller&amp;#x27;s wallet. Ordinary wallet ETH is separate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mint proceeds use Diagram 12." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
